          "label": "ODM 官方文件",
          "url": "https://docs.opendronemap.org/"
        },
        {
          "label": "參數說明",
          "url": "https://docs.opendronemap.org/arguments/"
        }
      ],
      "verified_at": "2026-11-15",
      "source_readme": "https://github.com/OpenDroneMap/ODM/blob/master/README.md",
      "source_blob_sha": "d3b8719f4e0ca35eebec1126d7decf1dc113ee54",
      "ingestion_scope": "已讀取來源 README 並撰寫主題摘要與教學應用；未抓取清單內所有外部網站，也未聲稱已把完整外部知識訓練進模型。",
